 ## Notes for the Reviewer
 
-—
+- Breaking change for consumers outside this repo: values from 1000 ms up
+  now render as `s` / `m s` instead of `<n>ms`. Non-integer, non-number and
+  non-finite input that used to return a string now throws `TypeError`.
+  The Approach asks for this, but no caller in this repo could be checked
+  (there are none), so a human should confirm downstream log parsers can
+  cope.
+- Ticket has no Fast path declaration. It changes runtime behavior and was
+  committed as `ticket 002` with Status in-progress. Please confirm it was
+  approved.
+- Outside the ACs, a probe confirmed the boundaries match the Approach:
+  999→"999ms", 1000→"1s", 1099→"1s", 1999→"1.9s", 59999→"59.9s",
+  60000→"1m 0s", 60999→"1m 0s", 3600000→"60m 0s", -0→"0ms",
+  1.5/Infinity/"1500"/null→TypeError. No tests cover these boundaries;
+  the Ticket asks for exactly one test per AC.
